{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（18日）上午11時27分，警方接報，紅磡家維邨家興樓泵房地下室傳出懷疑沼氣的異味，一名中年男技工感到不適和頭暈，不慎失足跣倒。他頸部受傷，救援人員到場將他送往伊利沙伯醫院治理，案件暫列工業意外跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"救護員為男技工戴上頸箍送院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260918/1177591454415982592374629.jpeg/p7-c-F_MRDTQhLPag4Sye8JPMlpl7t7suTrgX5M64F8\"/><figcaption>救護員為男技工戴上頸箍送院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名男技工進入泵房時疑受傷，感不適。（翁鈺料攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260918/1177588488690733056837169.jpeg/vuEGkZiLBX-Y73wRa1QstS6zkR5iDHMJH6FurjWhbq4\"/><figcaption>一名男技工進入泵房時疑受傷，感不適。（翁鈺料攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260918/1177591660813488128293478.jpeg/lcximcHIXJ44vgIkmfrtGNSBCWg_YBjZ5rXcEsy13BI\"/><figcaption>傷者送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260918/1177591663812546560614720.jpeg/ebf6Z_yEzUqBdna4orOO37TZT0cMij26Y63nTUmt500\"/><figcaption>傷者送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紅磡家維邨泵房疑傳出沼氣，一名男技工感不適，頸部亦同受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260918/1177587520889032704076128.jpeg/4K7EvBJeLRg41jMLNRtI01D6dQwpxpmDpenHlY_px5U\"/><figcaption>紅磡家維邨泵房疑傳出沼氣，一名男技工感不適，頸部亦同受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260918/1177587518288433152463518.jpeg/S_7QW7_SQ7S1WxZVBQbEAyz66FeCbKTLhxd1ya0Xdck\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為紅磡家維邨家興樓。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260918/1177587512663609344530124.jpeg/dVIRdRIMqEPFEnYcT5Y-E-TqkmB_uEakPPTt9xb07fc\"/><figcaption>現場為紅磡家維邨家興樓。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-18T04:20:09.799349+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":259,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}